Package: libti-rpmsg-char0
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 libc6
Description: TI RPMsg Character Device Library
 User space library for communicating with remote processors via the
 RPMsg framework on TI K3 SoCs (J721E, J784S4, J722S, AM62A, etc.).
 Provides the libti_rpmsg_char.so.0 shared library.

Package: libti-rpmsg-char-dev
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libti-rpmsg-char0 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: TI RPMsg Character Device Library - development files
 Development headers and symlinks for building against libti_rpmsg_char.
 Includes ti_rpmsg_char.h and the unversioned libti_rpmsg_char.so symlink.
